==Campaign==
===May election campaign===
Andrzej Duda during his time as President visited all counties, as he promised in his 2015 campaign, which some described as pre-election campaign.<ref>{{cite news |title=Prezydent Andrzej Duda zrealizował plan z kampanii. Odwiedził wszystkie powiaty |url=https://wiadomosci.wp.pl/prezydent-andrzej-duda-zrealizowal-plan-z-kampanii-odwiedzil-wszystkie-powiaty-6448253754964097a|agency=wp.pl |date=20 November 2019}}</ref> Małgorzata Kidawa-Błońska, Prime Ministerial candidate in [[2019 Polish parliamentary election|2019 election]] was chosen as candidate in [[2019 Civic Platform presidential primary|primary]] against Mayor of [[Poznań]] [[Jacek Jaśkowiak]] who was supported by people of leader of KO, Grzegorz Schetyna.<ref>{{cite news |title=Jacek Jaśkowiak uwierzył, że może być prezydentem Polski. Ale nie był kandydatem pierwszego wyboru|url=https://poznan.wyborcza.pl/poznan/7,36001,25434237,jacek-jaskowiak-uwierzyl-ze-moze-byc-prezydentem-polski-ale.html?_gl=1*g2rvj2*_gcl_au*MTE5MTMzOTE1NS4xNzUzNjk1MzYw*_ga*MTc5OTgxODk5MC4xNzUzNjk1MzU3*_ga_6R71ZMJ3KN*czE3NTQ3NTM0NzUkbzckZzAkdDE3NTQ3NTM0NzUkajYwJGwwJGgw#s=S.embed_article-K.C-B.1-L.2.zw|agency=wyborcza|date=21 November 2019}}</ref>

Kidawa-Błońska withdrew after new elections were scheduled. She was replaced by [[Rafał Trzaskowski]].

