==Results==
[[File:2020 Polish presidential election - 1st round results.svg|thumb|300px|Results of the first round.]]
[[File:Tomaszow Mazowiecki, presidential election in Poland, June 2020.jpg|thumb|Queue to vote just after the opening of the premises]]
[[File:2020 Presidential election in Poland, ballot box in Tomaszów Mazowiecki, Sikorskiego Street 6A.jpg|thumb|Ballot box]]
[[File:Premier tour présidentielle Pologne 2020 - Candidat en tête par voïvodie.png|upright|thumb|First place candidate of the first round, by Voivodeship.]]
[[File:Second tour présidentielle Pologne 2020 - Candidat en tête par voïvodie.png|upright|thumb|First place candidate of the second round, by Voivodeship.]]
As there was no outright winner in the first round, the top two candidates - Andrzej Duda and Rafał Trzaskowski - advanced to the second round. Szymon Hołownia and Krzysztof Bosak placed third and fourth respectively. Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz and Robert Biedroń both underperformed expectations taking the fifth and sixth place.<ref>{{Cite web|last1=WPROST.pl|last2=Bojakowski|first2=Jakub|date=2020-06-28|title=Robert Biedroń z fatalnym wynikiem. Kandydat Lewicy komentuje wynik wyborczy|url=https://www.wprost.pl/wybory-prezydenckie-2020/10338989/robert-biedron-z-fatalnym-wynikiem-kandydat-lewicy-komentuje-wynik-wyborczy.html|access-date=2020-07-13|website=Wprost|language=pl}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2020-06-29|title=Wyniki pierwszej tury wyborów. Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz nie kryje rozczarowania|url=https://www.o2.pl/informacje/wyniki-pierwszej-tury-wyborow-wladyslaw-kosiniak-kamysz-nie-kryje-rozczarowania-6526607097011040a|access-date=2020-07-13|website=o2.pl|language=pl}}</ref>

In the second round, there was a close race between Duda and Trzaskowski. Duda had a slight lead in 9:00 pm exit polls which gave him 50.4% of the vote to Trzaskowski's 49.6%. This was within the 2% margin of error leading to the pollster [[Ipsos]] announcing the race to be too close to call.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Kołodziejczyk|first=Bartosz|date=2020-07-12|title=Wyniki wyborów prezydenckich 2020. Pierwsze komentarze po II turze wyborów|url=https://wiadomosci.wp.pl/wyniki-wyborow-prezydenckich-2020-pierwsze-komentarze-po-ii-turze-wyborow-6531396206077569a|access-date=2020-07-13|website=wiadomosci.wp.pl|language=pl}}</ref> Duda's vote share eventually amounted to 51.03%, securing his reelection.

